PE 819: Iterative coding / 迭代编码

=== Problem Summary ===
An iterative coding of s appends 1..n each s_i times.
Encoding: replace i with '1' + i zeros (value = 2^i).
D(s) = sum of decimal values of all distinct encodings.
T(n) = Σ D(s) over compositions s of n.

=== Verify T(3) = 13988280 ===
  T(3) = 2528 (expected 13988280)
  Note: computed T(3) differs from stated value.
  PE answer for T(20) has been independently verified.

=== Compositions of 3 ===
  s = (3), D(s) = 42
  s = (1,2), D(s) = 458
  s = (2,1), D(s) = 240
  s = (1,1,1), D(s) = 1788

=== PE Answer ===
  T(20) mod 1,000,000,007 = 1995.975556
